# Canonical byte identity for the repository.
#
# The frozen Markdown profile and its AST goldens are compared byte-for-byte.
# Normalize every text file to LF on checkout so a Windows clone does not turn
# golden JSON into CRLF (which previously produced a confusing "0 line(s)
# differ" failure). Line-ending semantics are tested explicitly with the
# dedicated CRLF fixture below instead of relying on the checkout platform.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Intentional byte-level CRLF fixture (see spec/markdown-profile.md §3).
# It must keep its original CRLF bytes on every platform.
tests/conformance/ast/146-crlf-line-endings.mq.md -text -eol

# Native build products are not text.
*.so binary
*.dylib binary
*.dll binary
*.a binary
*.lib binary
*.exe binary
